  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/banner/header_paperdoll.png\" alt=\"紙娃娃橫幅\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/caVV5eXekm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Discord-Button-64.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/tr7zw/PaperDoll\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Github-Button-64.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpaperdoll\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Modrinth-Button-64.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paperdoll\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Curseforge-Button-64.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftr7zw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/social_buttons_icon/Kofi-Button-64.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a>\n</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/large/About.png\" alt=\"關於\"><br></p>\n<p>PaperDoll 是一款用戶端模組，為介面新增基岩版風格的紙娃娃。它具備高度的自訂能力，能透過提供更沉浸的角色視角來提升您的遊戲體驗。</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/large/Features.png\" alt=\"功能特色\"></p>\n<h3>功能豐富</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>支援觀望其他實體</li>\n<li>船隻等載具及其乘客會完整顯示</li>\n<li>與 Essential、Wavey Capes、3d Skin Layers 等模組高度相容</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>高度可自訂</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>自由放置與縮放紙娃娃</li>\n<li>完全可配置的顯示邏輯，僅在執行特定動作時顯示紙娃娃</li>\n<li>多樣的外觀與動作表現</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252ftr7zw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/banner/essential_1.png\" alt=\"Essential\"></a><br><br></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/Compatibility & Dependancys.png\" alt=\"相容性與相依性\"></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Minecraft</th>\n<th>載入器</th>\n<th>狀態</th>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>備註</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.16.5+</td>\n<td>Fabric/Forge<em>/NeoForge</em></td>\n<td>✅ 支援</td>\n<td>最新版</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>*1.21.6/7</td>\n<td>NeoForge</td>\n<td>❌ 不支援</td>\n<td>無法取得</td>\n<td>由於某些原因，NeoForge 對原版邏輯進行了大幅不相容的修改，目前導致該模組無法運作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>*1.16.5</td>\n<td>Forge</td>\n<td>⚠️ 未支援</td>\n<td>過時</td>\n<td>暫不支援，待支援 JarInJar 模組後再開放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/Screenshots Media.png\" alt=\"截圖與媒體\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/tr7zw/PaperDoll/raw/1.18/screenshots/boats.png\" alt=\"紙娃娃範例\"></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/Known Issues.png\" alt=\"已知問題\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>部分騎乘載具可能無法正確顯示</li>\n<li>不支援發光效果</li>\n<li>Detailed Animation 模組的方向判定似乎有問題</li>\n<li>騎馬跳躍時的偏移量不正確</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/FAQ.png\" alt=\"常見問題\"></p>\n<h3>伺服器需要安裝此模組嗎？</h3>\n<p>不需要。這是一個純用戶端模組，<strong>不需要</strong>安裝在伺服器上。</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/divider_faded/Divider_04.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/headlines/medium/Credits & License.png\" alt=\"致謝與授權\"></p>\n<p>👤 感謝 Github 上傑出的翻譯者與貢獻者！\n<a href=\"https://github.com/tr7zw/PaperDoll/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://tr7zw.github.io/uikit/links/underlined/more_details.png\" alt=\"更多詳情\">\n</a> <br><br>\n📄 授權條款：tr7zw 保護性授權 <br>\n歡迎在您的 Modrinth/CurseForge 整合包中免費使用此模組，無需事先詢問。請勿將 jar 檔分發至其他平台！</p>",
